  "content": "\n\n<h1>Cobblemon Raid Dens × Xaero/JourneyMap</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1604194.svg\" alt=\"版本\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_64h.png\" alt=\"Fabric\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/thomasglasser/thomasglasser/blob/main/files/badges/cozy/supported/neoforge_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></p>\n<p>在地圖上顯示 <strong>Cobblemon Raid Dens</strong>（Xaero 或 JourneyMap），讓您在探索時能直接於地圖上看到團體戰巢穴的位置。</p>\n<p>自 1.2 版本起，JourneyMap 已改為選用性依賴，並新增 Xaero 支援。</p>\n<h2>📦 需求</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cobblemon</strong> <code>1.7.3</code></li>\n<li><strong>Cobblemon Raid Dens</strong> <code>0.11.3+</code></li>\n<li><strong>JourneyMap</strong> <code>6.0+</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🔮 規劃中</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>可自訂地圖圖示大小</li>\n<li><del>Xaero 支援</del> 已完成</li>\n<li><del>NeoForge 支援</del> 已完成</li>\n</ul>\n<p>我的整合包：<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/cobblewatch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/kg0VTRKw/Untitled-125.jpg\" alt=\"cobblewatch\"></a></p>\n<p>查看我的其他模組：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpet-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G1XpmL4.png\" alt=\"carpet-variants\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-deco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/8c2kJqYK/copperdeco125.png\" alt=\"copper-deco\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-loot-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n1X16BM.png\" alt=\"mob-loot-variants\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-block-sounds-fork\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/epM9STT.png\" alt=\"better-block-sounds-fork\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slime-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/7LPXcWkr/so-logo-mini.png\" alt=\"slime-overhaul\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polyglot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/d3RCh0RZ/polyglot-mini.jpg\" alt=\"polyglot\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/hytale/mods/weapon-mastery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/C1fM4HHC/WM125.jpg\" alt=\"weapon-mastery\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/big-water\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/NMB0gG5S/icon.png\" alt=\"bigwater\"></a></p>",
